                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\infty,n)
            %em generated
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/strict+n-categories"} strict n-categories
            in a certain sense. Therefore we first need to fix some terminology and notions about strict
            = succeed "-categories" do
