          %p
            This is prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompleteSegalOvernFoldSimplicialSetsIsPresentation"}
            in view of the presentation discussed
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#PresentationByCompleteSegal"} below
          %h4#PresentationByCompleteSegal
