            = succeed "-fold" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
          %p
            By the discussion
            %a{:href => "category+object+in+an+%28infinity,1%29-category#ModelCategoryPresentations"} here
            at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+object+in+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} category object in an (∞,1)-category
            we have
          .num_prop
            %h6#proposition_8 Proposition
            %p
              Write
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
